# Local CLI protocol
- `LocalCliProtocol`: 4-byte little-endian length prefix + compact JSON envelope (`type`, `payload`).
- Frame types in use: `hello`, `hello-ack`, `command`, `complete`, `complete-result`, `response`, `info`, `error`, `result`, `bye`, `ping`.
- `hello-ack` may include `features` (currently `complete`). `complete` payload is `{text, cursor}`; `complete-result` is `{replace_from, replace_to, values, append_space}`.
- `LocalCliRegistry` stores JSON descriptors under `QStandardPaths::GenericDataLocation/booking-resources/local-cli` (with fallbacks).
- Registry files: `booking-resources-<pid>.json` with keys `pid`, `endpoint`, `executable`, `started_at` (ISO).
- `LocalCliRegistry::defaultServerName(pid)` returns `booking-resources-<pid>` and falls back to `QCoreApplication::applicationPid()` when pid is not provided.
